WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.037 --> 00:00:05.352
"The duke got June?" Pip cries.

2
00:00:05.353 --> 00:00:09.258
"This is bad news," Jane says.

3
00:00:09.259 --> 00:00:13.813
Blue Ralph nods. "It seems true.

4
00:00:13.814 --> 00:00:22.832
Now you must rescue June and the queen."

5
00:00:22.833 --> 00:00:28.824
He shows the kids where the road is.

6
00:00:28.825 --> 00:00:32.950
"Go to the top of Ice Cream Hill.

7
00:00:32.951 --> 00:00:36.921
Then follow the road to the castle."

8
00:00:36.922 --> 00:00:41.617
"Will you come?" Jane asks.

9
00:00:41.618 --> 00:00:56.005
"No," Ralph says.

10
00:00:56.006 --> 00:01:10.124
"I must keep Cocoa Stream safe from monsters."

11
00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:19.582
The kids take the road up the hill.

12
00:01:19.583 --> 00:01:25.901
Jane shakes. "It's cold!"

13
00:01:25.902 --> 00:01:29.879
Pip tastes the snow.

14
00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:33.168
"Ew." Jane makes a face.

15
00:01:33.169 --> 00:01:43.957
Pip grins. "It's ice cream!"

16
00:01:43.958 --> 00:01:50.610
The kids keep going up the hill.

17
00:01:50.611 --> 00:01:55.526
Jane sighs. "This is a big job.

18
00:01:55.527 --> 00:01:59.049
Can we save Sweet Land on our own?

19
00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:03.673
Ralph had to help us in the boat."

20
00:02:03.674 --> 00:02:08.513
Pip makes a fist. "We can do it!

21
00:02:08.514 --> 00:02:15.922
And we're almost at the top."

22
00:02:15.923 --> 00:02:22.533
The kids take some more steps.

23
00:02:22.534 --> 00:02:29.701
"Phew," Jane says. "We made it."

24
00:02:29.702 --> 00:02:35.041
"I see all of Sweet Land!" Pip says.

25
00:02:35.042 --> 00:02:38.305
Jane groans.

26
00:02:38.306 --> 00:02:44.750
"And there is slime all over the land."

